    "text": "BY virtue of the powers vested in me by Section 27(1) of the Universities Act, No. 16 of 1978, I, Lakshman Kiriella,Minister of Higher Education and Highways, on the recommendation of the University Grants Commission, do by thisOrder, amend the Schedule to the Order made under Section 21 of the said Act, published in Gazette ExtraordinaryNo. 896/2 of November 07, 1995 (as last amended by Order published in Gazette Extraordinary No. 1954/45 of February19, 2016) which specifies the Faculties and Departments of the Sabaragamuwa University of Sri Lanka, by the additionimmediately after the item \u201cFacultry of Geomatics\u201d appearing in Column I of the Schedule and its corresponding entriesin Column II of the Schedule of the following item and entries :-",
